2026-11-18 23:22:36,927 - test - INFO - Existing record: {'id': UUID('01a1ef25-a4d9-7d94-a44b-5d010409d29a'), 'title': 'Motorcyclist crushed by tree in Selayang | FMT', 'link': 'https://www.freemalaysiatoday.com/category/nation/2026/11/18/motorcyclist-crushed-by-tree-in-selayang', 'snippet': 'PETALING JAYA: A 26-year-old motorcyclist died after a tree fell and crushed him in Selayang, Selangor, following a thunderstorm this afternoon.\nThe tree had fallen onto a lorry and a motorcycle during bad weather, pinning the motorcyclist underneath.', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 11, 18, 18, 53, 4, 51195, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'source': 'www.freemalaysiatoday.com', 'article_language': None, 'article_type': 'news', 'content': 'PETALING JAYA: A 26-year-old motorcyclist died after a tree fell and crushed him in Selayang, Selangor, following a thunderstorm this afternoon.\nThe Selangor fire and rescue department said it was alerted to the incident at Jalan Set 2/8, Setia Eco Templer at about 2.20pm after a tree had fallen onto a lorry and a motorcycle, trapping the motorcyclist underneath the debris.\nThe victim was extricated about 15 minutes later and pronounced dead at the scene.\nThe tree, which had blocked the road in one direction, was removed by 3.20pm.', 'content_status': 'completed', 'content_error': None, 'embedding': '[0.01074477,0.028280592,-0.00810798,-0.032075174,-0.0029062228,-0.085433014,-0.013143218,-0.02650174,-0.018432345,0.011325145,0.025648527,0.016899424,-0.017500587,0.0017133384,0.0411225,0.0040409667,0.092439756,0.024889093,-0.0005858234,-0.025693836,0.019401886,0.018646026,-0.019302651,-0.0048317276,-0.0038451613,0.009599133,0.0065546185,-0.017046126,0.015438963,0.0025538467,-0.008140484,0.009277139,0.03798864,-0.014360201,-0.050102934,0.0058486755,-1.1176139e-05,-0.0010428516,-0.020464867,0.045989696,0.010790453,0.0077146934,0.044787943,-1.090212e-05,0.00618304,0.0031110612,-0.019687902,-0.023700224,0.016587982,-0.04711439