2026-11-18 23:33:05,381 - test - INFO - Existing record: {'id': UUID('01a1ef25-a572-7d6f-99b5-11ada2b630b6'), 'title': 'Micron Technology Eyes Technical Rebound, Eyes US$830 Upside Target: RHB', 'link': 'https://businesstoday.com.my/2026/11/18/micron-technology-eyes-technical-rebound-eyes-us830-upside-target-rhb', 'snippet': "Reach Publishing Sdn Bhd 15-3, Block F1, Jalan PJU 1/42, Dataran Prima, 47301, Petaling Jaya, Selangor\nMicron Technology Inc is showing signs of a potential countertrend rebound after bouncing off a key support level, according to RHB Investment Bank's latest technical analysis.", 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 11, 18, 15, 53, 4, 51260, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'source': 'businesstoday.com.my', 'article_language': None, 'article_type': 'news', 'content': 'Micron Technology Inc is showing signs of a potential countertrend rebound after bouncing off a key support level, according to RHB Investment Bank’s latest technical analysis.\nThe research house noted that the semiconductor stock had formed a candlestick with a long lower shadow, indicating strong buying interest near the US$675 support level.\nA decisive breakout above the immediate resistance of US$730 could pave the way for further gains towards US$770, followed by the higher resistance level of US$830.\nThe technical formation suggests that buying momentum could be returning following the stock’s recent downside correction.\nHowever, RHB cautioned that a fall below the US$675 support level would invalidate the potential rebound and trigger a resumption of the bearish trend.\nInvestors should closely monitor the US$730 resistance level for confirmation of a bullish breakout, while the US$675 threshold remains critical in determining the stock’s near-term direction.', 'content_status': 'completed', 'content_error': None, 'embedding': '[-0.01135493,-0.03061296,-0.024068614,0.026589222,-0.004649113,0.0013425661,-0.027945708,0.01632027,-0.026276404,0.017974772,-0.02